Cancellation & Refund Policy
Website: https://www.astrojak.in/
Business Name: ASTROJAK

1. Overview
ASTROJAK provides online Vedic astrology consultations, Kundali analysis, marriage matchmaking and personalised horoscope reports.
This policy explains the conditions for cancellations, rescheduling and refunds.
2. Cancellation Before Consultation
Customers who wish to cancel a booking before the consultation has started must contact our support team through email or WhatsApp with their booking and payment details.
Cancellation and refund requests will be reviewed based on the service status and circumstances of the request.
3. Refund After Service Delivery
Once the consultation has started or the service has been completed, refunds will generally not be provided, as the service involves personalised professional time and analysis.
Dissatisfaction with astrological predictions or the absence of a specific expected outcome shall not independently qualify for a refund.
4. Rescheduling
Customers who cannot attend their scheduled appointment should inform us as early as possible.
Rescheduling requests will be accommodated subject to availability and confirmation from our team.
5. Failed or Duplicate Payments
If an amount is debited but the booking is not confirmed, or a customer is charged multiple times for the same booking, the customer should contact us with the transaction details.
After verification, eligible duplicate or failed transactions will be processed for a refund through the original payment within 5-6 business days
6. Refund Processing
Approved refunds will be initiated through the original payment method, subject to payment provider and banking timelines.(5-6 business days)
